OL,4,CPip assessments need 'fundamental      
OL,5,Coverhaul', report to say               
OL,6,GA review into the personal             
OL,7,Gindependence payment (Pip) will call   
OL,8,Gfor a "fundamental overhaul" of the    
OL,9,Gassessment process to "better          
OL,10,Grecognise people's varying costs and   
OL,11,Gneeds", the disability minister has    
OL,12,Gsaid.                                  
OL,14,FSir Stephen Timms has been looking     
OL,15,Finto disability benefits in England    
OL,16,Fand Wales for the past year and found  
OL,17,Fthe set up was "no longer fit for      
OL,18,Fpurpose".                              
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
